 and stocking decisions"}, {"id": "d0d4c666-3db2-4b8e-aa91-8564f19579d6", "type": "concept", "title": "Slow-moving and obsolete inventory policy"}, {"id": "17820bb5-4d33-47b9-8f6b-fa0d41cb13bb", "type": "concept", "title": "Exception management rules"}], "description": "Students learn to assign different planning rules to different item groups."}]}, {"id": "10bdf796-27b5-4e0e-98bc-9ec64373656e", "type": "topic", "title": "Warehouse Network Role, Layout, Slotting, and Space Planning", "description": "Design warehouse flows, storage zones, slotting logic, and capacity use.", "children": [{"id": "6c1331b2-58c4-4edf-b12d-ce2800b8306d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Warehouse layout fundamentals", "children": [{"id": "d4d34825-7881-49f9-b2e5-2c6ebc6f8982", "type": "concept", "title": "Receiving, staging, reserve storage, forward pick, packing, shipping, and returns zones"}, {"id": "2557f786-0f8a-40e6-ba52-794f3ba5ed07", "type": "concept", "title": "U-flow, I-flow, and L-flow layouts"}, {"id": "8dbe57f8-ce05-46e8-a2a3-7d2c46fafd08", "type": "concept", "title": "Aisle design and dock planning"}, {"id": "643dea81-9de9-40ed-83c8-a8e225c9effc", "type": "concept", "title": "Congestion and bottlenecks"}], "description": "Layout determines travel distance, congestion, safety, and throughput. Students learn to design flow before choosing tools."}, {"id": "a8b877ed-9370-4276-9269-a6a1e23e41e7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Slotting strategy", "children": [{"id": "aa71b8c8-cf95-493e-abf3-0192935cfbfd", "type": "concept", "title": "Velocity-based slotting"}, {"id": "cb3e03f8-ac6e-47fb-a4a9-bf9775e5ee81", "type": "concept", "title": "Cube, weight, fragility, and compatibility"}, {"id": "aa387704-969b-448f-96cb-af03ffee70f9", "type": "concept", "title": "Ergonomic and safety constraints"}, {"id": "5419c37f-7d0d-4f70-bf08-c6e7d43b7a50", "type": "concept", "title": "Re-slotting cadence"}], "description": "Slotting places items where they improve productivity and service."}, {"id": "ecf