"02f2e3b8-e1d7-4d59-9fc8-7642cd14ff48", "type": "concept", "title": "Cross-docking opportunities"}], "description": "This subtopic explains how inventory moves from dock to storage to pick locations."}, {"id": "88defa65-c332-4998-b2a3-e8220a020d2e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Shipping and outbound accuracy", "children": [{"id": "4fada4cd-aff5-4a05-b540-27e8ebbf4659", "type": "concept", "title": "Staging and loading"}, {"id": "bd70e381-3b35-40bb-9838-62aba6598159", "type": "concept", "title": "Carrier handoff"}, {"id": "5f8c0d84-1f1b-494e-b985-586c35d01f2a", "type": "concept", "title": "Documentation and scan compliance"}, {"id": "8e0797ad-8584-4501-ba74-281e2f7cdba9", "type": "concept", "title": "On-time, complete, damage-free shipments"}], "description": "Students learn how outbound controls protect customer service and cost."}]}, {"id": "da50d503-182d-475d-8c65-2378b79ec3ac", "type": "topic", "title": "Material Handling, Packaging, Ergonomics, and Safety", "description": "Evaluate handling systems, packaging choices, labor safety, and risk controls.", "children": [{"id": "2fffd38d-69e0-42df-b923-cbd198dd6441", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Handling equipment and methods", "children": [{"id": "ecc9fe60-8bf4-4e0d-b4d6-0c84081f2aca", "type": "concept", "title": "Forklifts, pallet jacks, conveyors, carts, cranes, AS/RS, and goods-to-person systems"}, {"id": "0a8d17a7-3874-4b31-b2bf-86723fb0ba85", "type": "concept", "title": "Pallets, totes, bins, racks, and shelving"}, {"id": "d1910af2-4ab0-48a2-bd99-f8998d4251a5", "type": "concept", "title": "Unit load design"}, {"id": "bbbac97a-551e-4d6f-b263-9ed4806c89cd", "type": "concept", "title": "Equipment utilization and maintenance"}], "description": "Students learn to match handling methods to product, volume, labor, and safety requirements."}, {"id": "f4bb5ef5-9474-427d-a11d-ee5661b27ddb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Packaging and protection", "children": [{"id": "b4ea3fce-c5c0-41ca-90a3-d3ce970f266d", "type": "concept", "title": "Primary, secondary, and tertiary packaging"}, {"id": "ae7265b8-b011-4bc2-ac1e-1cf652aab02f", "type": "concept", "title": "Dunnage, labeling, and hazmat requirements"}, {"id": "8821179f-f77c-4b05-8475-393759bf639f", "type": "concept", "title": "Dimensional weight and cube efficiency"}, {"id": "247a06fe-639d-4698-b337-502b16a0cfb8", "type": "concept", "title": "Reusable and recyclable packaging"}], "description": "Packaging affects damage, cube, labor, and sustainability."}, {"id": "177c2360-0d48-46c4-b4c9-214d2de9b854", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Ergonomics and safety", "children": [{"id": "efe91bd6-0edc-453e-8d2b-e7817c959344", "type": "concept", "title": "Lift limits and repetitive motion"}, {"id": "e586b66b-f1a1-437b-8a62-21610aa6d867", "type": "concept", "title": "Traffic separation"}, {"id": "3a3aa917-7c97-4acb-aa05-d384213c8167", "type": "concept", "title": "OSHA basics and incident reporting"}, {"id": "eb9f4402-0f4d-4121-88ae-d54e786c60f4", "type": "concept", "title": "Safety observations and corrective actions"}], "description": "Warehouse design must protect people. Students learn the safety implications of layout, handling, and pace."}]}, {"id": "98678405-337e-41a5-93a3-950165c5334f", "type": "topic", "title": "Order Picking, Packing, Fulfillment, and Omnichannel Operations", "description": "Improve picking methods, packing quality, fulfillment speed, and customer promise reliability.", "children": [{"id": "6c46382c-123f-41f1-8591-ace5fa3340b3", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Picking methods", "children": [{"id": "8d786e4e-8999-48a0-b945-9595d2fbf9aa", "type": "concept", "title": "Discrete, batch, zone, wave, cluster, and goods-to-person picking"}, {"id": "8afc3f02-399d-4076-b16e-06f0dfdf6933", "type": "concept", "title": "Pick path design"}, {"id": "afc0b053-1557-451e-8365-7aab2c76f768", "type": "concept", "title": "Pick-to-light, voice picking, and mobile scanning"}, {"id": "6c16db66-6929-4012-af9a-aa66f14cc1bd", "type": "concept", "title": "Accuracy and productivity tradeoffs"}], "description": "Picking is often the biggest warehouse labor cost. Students learn how different methods fit different order profiles."}, {"id": "0dccb002-d5cc-4a9f-bd59-e0f4930b7ff5", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Packing and fulfillment quality", "children": [{"id": "b301c986-f373-41a6-a441-7314252b90c3", "type": "concept", "title": "Pack station design"}, {"id": "cc1863d7-5edb-4aaf-a416-2b31746f98cb", "type": "concept", "title": "Packaging selection"}, {"id": "f4398156-972d-41ea-b51b-653dd3992488", "type": "concept", "title": "Quality checks"}, {"id": "d272f0f2-6fc0-428d-9915-aa2ad74378a4", "type": "concept", "title": "Shipment documentation and labeling"}], "description": "This subtopic covers the final steps that shape customer experience."}, {"id": "b0a9d2e6-a1f4-4ef7-82dd-70f7c0070b4d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Omnichannel fulfillment", "children": [{"id": "d360d940-6c22-4977-8e71-c68d685109e8", "type": "concept", "title": "Ship-from-warehouse, ship-from-store, BOPIS, and dropship"}, {"id": "d41d5f14-6249-4cc9-b41f-13f4fe87578f", "type": "concept", "title": "Order promising and allocation"}, {"id": "353f0b5c-d8bf-4eab-a492-dbba9c5c3292", "type": "concept", "title": "Returns and reverse logistics"}, {"id": "27edde76-15a5-4484-a8f4-1d7e39720f70", "type": "concept", "title": "Peak-season execution"}], "description": "Students learn how ecommerce, stores, wholesale, and marketplace channels complicate warehouse execution."}]}, {"id": "6c6421e2-a727-425b-9dce-a73cefcdfe09", "type": "topic", "title": "Inventory Accuracy, Cycle Counting, Shrinkage, and Audits", "description": "Control physical and system inventory through counting, reconciliation, and root-cause analysis.", "children": [{"id": "46fc26b4-ff05-4f0f-8ab7-7b3472a96931", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Inventory records and physical accuracy", "children": [{"id": "b9825c49-5d9b-41b5-94f7-1b1fca5f805f", "type": "concept", "title": "Book versus physical inventory"}, {"id": "a8ad4fc4-92eb-4e53-b3af-f5e87dc8798a", "type": "concept", "title": "Location accuracy"}, {"id": "0c876ee8-4edb-4465-911c-b5a19b745047", "type": "concept", "title": "Transaction discipline"}, {"id": "f4d150d7-04a2-4c59-a2cb-103317b96901", "type": "concept", "title": "Root causes of discrepancies"}], "description": "Students learn why system inventory must match reality for planning to work."}, {"id": "f061ce59-27d3-48db-ad3e-accd3a9795d9", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Cycle counting systems", "children": [{"id": "79ba50c2-a377-4c5a-bdf1-a8acffce176c", "type": "concept", "title": "ABC count frequency"}, {"id": "e7b32400-6df3-4732-87fc-ad21700edb03", "type": "concept", "title": "Blind counts and recount rules"}, {"id": "9433b38b-3b59-4aad-9d23-cd1cb4dc2292", "type": "concept", "title": "Tolerance thresholds"}, {"id": "7328dbc4-aee0-453e-b1eb-e6db13f17839", "type": "concept", "title": "Count accuracy and process correction"}], "description": "Cycle counting replaces panic-driven annual counts with regular control."}, {"id": "b668187b-f8fb-4198-b7a2-d2387ab5d112", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Shrinkage and audit control", "children": [{"id": "512b3f19-2472-49ef-8f8c-4299c713ef9f", "type": "concept", "title": "Theft, damage, mispicks, misreceipts, and write-offs"}, {"id": "8637ffe7-e0bc-4960-8609-54456ccdaee4", "type": "concept", "title": "Segregation of duties"}, {"id": "2a0c0c0e-b241-424d-aed9-e8b44bc4dcda", "type": "concept", "title": "Audit trails"}, {"id": "d2b8eb38-c29f-4bab-a285-bdecaa74bba5", "type": "concept", "title": "Corrective action and prevention"}], "description": "This section covers loss prevention and compliance around inventory assets."}]}, {"id": "803139b3-d9d5-4a42-96e1-a4c07bbfd65d", "type": "topic", "title": "WMS, ERP, Barcoding, RFID, Automation, and Robotics", "description": "Use warehouse technologies and enterprise systems to improve visibility and execution.", "children": [{"id": "393f30ca-7519-40ca-97f2-1157b86c7cb3", "type": "